    "badge": "Good to know",
    "title": "White Dune FAQ",
    "q1": {
      "question": "How far is the White Dune from Dakhla town?",
      "answer": "It is a drive along the lagoon. Confirm current access and transfer time with your hotel or kite camp."
    },
    "q2": {
      "question": "Is the climb difficult?",
      "answer": "Short but soft sand. Average fitness is enough; carry water and wear closed shoes."
    },
    "q3": {
      "question": "Best time for the White Dune?",
      "answer": "Late afternoon into sunset for the strongest colours over the lagoon."
    },
    "q4": {
      "question": "Can I combine it with Dragon Island?",
      "answer": "Yes. Both fit a shared lagoon outing with a driver or tour."
    },
    "q5": {
      "question": "Are there facilities at the dune?",
      "answer": "Very limited. Bring water, sun protection and anything else you need."
    }
